<summary>prettier/prettier</summary>

### [`v2.8.2`](https://togithub.com/prettier/prettier/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;282)

[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/prettier/prettier/compare/2.8.1...2.8.2)

